ding customization! You can now bind mouse buttons and additional keys, including those used by accessibility devices.- 🔭 Adjustable FOV! You can now tweak your Field of View to suit your playstyle.- 🔧 Bug fixes & polish! A handful of minor fixes to make you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:12:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032834","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:43:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1847286114032821","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"SONAR will support 1-6 players in the submarine.","summary":"All hands on deck, crew!You asked for room for more friends, and we’ve been listening! Here at Abylight Barcelona, we’re excited to announce that S.O.N.A.R. - Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready is increasing its crew limit to six players per submarine!That means two more friends to help operate the stations, repair the damage, and explain why the flooding definitely wasn’t their fault. Either in Coop or Open World Survival mode.And with bigger crews come bigger battles: Team Deathmatch is ex","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:10:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032821","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:43:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1846651706691422","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Demo is Live for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Ahoy, Submarine Operators!We are beyond thrilled to announce that S.O.N.A.R. - Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready is participating in Steam Next Fest, October 19th to 26th. If you've been itching to see how well you and your crew handle underwater chaos (or utter disaster), now is your chance to dive in.Here is what is waiting for you in the official Steam Next Fest demo:Brand New CoOp Mission: Experience a brand new mission not available before, built specifically for 1-4 players in coop mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1846651706690115","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Changelog version 0.9.41.0","summary":"Navigation station reworked to show a geographical view complementing the mission map viewImproved Weapon Station that can now launch a decoy to evade enemy torpedoesSecond mission of the current demo changed for a new one so people who have already played the demo have a reason to share with more friends againController vibration added to gamepadFixed a bug where changing the language during gameplay caused some characters to disappear in Asian languages.Chinese players now use a different P2P ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:02:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1846018067928869","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Hits 100,000 Wishlists – Meet our artists!","summary":"We are absolutely thrilled to announce that S.O.N.A.R. - Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready has officially crossed 100,000 wishlists on Steam! Thank you!For an indie team like ours, reaching this milestone means the world. Every single wishlist and message of support helps our crew navigate these uncharted waters. If you haven't already, make sure to download the free demo and tell your friends to join the crew, because navigating submarine chaos is always better (and funnier) together!Meet ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T09:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1845383656393045","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Price Reveal","summary":"We’re getting closer to S.O.N.A.R.’s launch on October 29th, and we can’t wait to see you and your friends take the helm. Who’s steering, who’s on sonar, and who’s already pressing buttons they probably shouldn’t?Today, we’re sharing something that should make getting the whole crew together a little easier: the launch price!This is something we’ve thought about a lot. From the beginning, we wanted S.O.N.A.R. to be an affordable game; something you can easily pick up with a few friends and spend","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T10:09:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393045","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1845383656377748","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Have the dive of your life! The S.O.N.A.R. demo is dropping now.","summary":"Hey there, captains and crewmates!As we get closer to the official launch of S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready) on October 29th, we here at Abylight Studios want to invite you to test the waters ahead of time. Starting today, September 30th, the playable demo will officially be available on Steam!If you and your crew thrive under pressure and want to see if your friendship can actually survive extreme ocean conditions, this is your moment.What awaits you in the demo?Cooperative ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T14:02:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1844751498231073","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Last Playtest Recap","summary":"All Hands on Deck!Our latest S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready) playtest and tournament has officially ended, and we want to share some exciting milestones with you:Over 150,000 playtest requests were submitted, and more than 85,000 people played. Thank you so much!We are completely overwhelmed by the massive interest the game has sparked, which drives us to keep improving it ahead of launch.The average playtime was 1.5 hours, a fantastic sign, especially considering that some s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T10:03:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231073","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1844751498217987","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Seize the moment: Try Team Deathmatch Mode in the final S.O.N.A.R. playtest!","summary":"Gather your crew because we are launching the final S.O.N.A.R. playtest very soon. Get ready to put your friendships to the ultimate test in intense 4v4 multiplayer battles between two submarines. Alongside the classic Deathmatch mode, this final playtest will also feature a brand-new cooperative mission!📅 Playtest DatesStart: Thursday, September 24th End: Monday, September 28thBut that's not all! Head over to our Discord server to join an exclusive crew championship: get the highest score and w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T10:09:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217987","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1843481262701255","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Release Date Announcement","summary":"It’s official: S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready) is diving onto Steam on October 29th.Grab your crew and get ready for some seriously chaotic underwater teamwork. S.O.N.A.R. is a 1–4 player online co-op submarine simulator where communication is key, panic is basically guaranteed, and things can go wrong very, very fast.Sneak through high-stakes stealth missions, survive intense combat operations, hunt for treasure in the deep sea, and somehow keep your cutting-edge submarine i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T10:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701255","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1843481262688560","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #3 - New Missions and Features","summary":"Attention all crew, this is your Captain speaking! Once again, we have a very important announcement for our community. We are thrilled to reveal the imminent arrival of Playtest #3 for S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready) right here on Steam!📅 Playtest DatesStart: Thursday, September 10th, End: Monday, September 14th,🛠️ What’s New in Playtest #3?The Treasure Recovery Station: A brand-new station to hunt and salvage valuable loot from the depths.Single Player Tutorial: Learn the r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T10:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688560","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1842846814442791","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. OST. The return of legendary composer Alberto “McAlby” González","summary":"All hands on deck! We have a new and exciting announcement regarding S.O.N.A.R. Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready development. We are proudly confirming our beloved composer Alberto J. González “McAlby” will be returning for the original soundtrack.With a career spanning over three decades since entering the video game industry in the late 1980s, McAlby is one of the most prolific figures in European game audio history, having contributed to more than 100 titles. As a co-founder of both Bit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T09:55:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442791","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1842212951296508","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Behind the scenes and submarine tour","summary":"Ever wondered how realistic submarine games actually are? Join Abylight’s Creative Director Miguel García Corchero and Marketing Lead David Martínez for an exclusive tour inside the Spanish Navy's legendary S-61 Dolphin submarine!We walked through the cramped corridors, torpedo rooms, and command centers of a real life submarine to compare it side by side with our upcoming coop sim, S.O.N.A.R. Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready. Discover how true to life naval engineering directly inspires o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T10:33:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1840310314353741","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"S.O.N.A.R. Developer Interview","summary":"Attention, crew!We have an exciting deep dive for you today. Get access to an exclusive interview with the core developer behind S.O.N.A.R. Submarine Operators Not actually Ready!Miguel García Corchero, Creative Director at Abylight Barcelona, sat down with us to pull back the curtain on the game's development. Here is a sneak peek at what we cover in the video:The Core Inspiration: What sparked the idea for a chaotic, co-op submarine simulator?Key Gameplay Mechanics: How teamwork, crisis manage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:42:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1839676055894390","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 Recap","summary":"Attention all crew members!Playtest #2 for S.O.N.A.R. Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready has officially come to an end. Thank you for joining in this amazing adventure, Mission Accomplished! ⚓️After an exciting weekend of testing out our newest features, it’s time for us to head back into full development, there’s still much to do. But before we dive deeper into production, we need your help!How can you support us?💬 Join our Discord: Drop in and share all your feedback, bugs, and wild ideas ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T10:10:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1839676055885329","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"New mission incoming. Playtest #2 is starting soon","summary":"All hands on deck! A new transmission just came in from HQ. First of all, a massive, heartfelt thank you for making our first playtest round such a blast. You have surpassed all our expectations! Because of that success, and because we hate leaving anyone stranded at the docks, we’ve decided to launch a second playtest round for everyone who missed the boat the first time around. The best part? You won't have to twiddle your thumbs for long. This second test is happening tomorrow: starting July ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T13:59:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1839041357035757","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #1 Recap","summary":"Our first playtest has officially come to an end, and the response has been incredible: Over 75,000 players signed up, and more than 42,000 joined us underwater! Most importantly, you told us that you had fun playing with your friends and that makes us incredibly happy. Thank you for playing, reporting bugs, sharing ideas, and helping us make the game better. ❤️ We’ve been reading your feedback across Discord, the Steam forums, and the in-game survey. Here are some of the most common topics. You","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T13:57:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357035757","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1839041357024006","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Man your battle stations! Playtest dates revealed. INVITE YOUR FRIENDS","summary":"All hands on deck! We have a major update for you. Since we first announced S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready), we’ve been inviting you to sign up for our upcoming playtest. Please keep in mind that this early build doesn't represent the final quality of the game, but it will give you a fantastic taste of how the mechanics work, how vital teamwork is aboard a submarine, and the hilariously chaotic situations waiting for you and your crew. We know you've been dying to jump in, so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T14:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096830-1838407329256650","game_id":"steam-4096830","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome aboard","summary":"First, a quick introduction for those who might be new here: we are Abylight Barcelona. You might know us from our recent strategy and city building games like One Military Camp or Citadelum, but our roots actually go back more than 20 years. We’ve been making games since the 8 bit microcomputer era, developing for almost every platform since! Today, we are incredibly excited to announce our next big project: S.O.N.A.R. (Submarine Operators Not Actually Ready). We started working on this title l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T13:13:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256650","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4096830"